                  <div class="testblocktxt">
                        <p>"My husband and I were in an accident where we both received head injuries. We had many calls from attorneys who wanted to represent us. Scott was recommended to us by a friend of our son-in-law. We decided to go into his office and discuss the case. After our office conference, we retained Scott on the spot. His professional approach and self-confidence gave us the belief that he would do the best possible job for us. It proved to be one of the best decisions of our lives. Scott kept..." <a href="https://www.righthandfirm.com/reviews/">Read More</a></p>
